    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73412" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the
				whole,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντες καθ᾽ ὁμάδα</span> all
				<i>together,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gp.
				10.2.3
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὁμάδι</span> in <i>one
				lump sum,</i> Men.Prot.<i><span class="en">
				p.15
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> ; but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὁμάδι τὸ πρᾶγμα διοικούμενον</span>”
				<i>comprehensively,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Just.
					<u>Edict.</u>
					13
				</span></i>
			<u>Praef.</u>
